message: "If you use this dataset or its accompanying software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Manṭiq al-ṭayr: A TEI–IIIF Manuscript Transcription Prototype for BnF Persan 348"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/KidoIshi/mantiq-al-tayr-tei-iiif"
url: "https://github.com/KidoIshi/mantiq-al-tayr-tei-iiif"
authors:
  - family-names: Ishikawa
    given-names: Kido
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2254-2189"
    website: "https://researchmap.jp/kidoishi/"
abstract: >-
  A small-scale TEI P5 transcription of nine Persian couplets from BnF
  Persan 348, reviewed against the manuscript image by the project researcher,
  aligned with eighteen IIIF Canvas regions, and exported as an IIIF
  Presentation 3 AnnotationPage. This review is not external peer review.
keywords:
  - TEI
  - IIIF
  - Persian literature
  - manuscript studies
  - Manṭiq al-ṭayr
  - Farīd al-Dīn ʿAṭṭār
